        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bobile na balwana amweenzinyina, na mwanakazi waumwi waboola kuzoovuna mulumaakwe mumaanza aayooyo ngobalwana awe, alimwi watambika ijanza lyakwe akumujata kubuntu bwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
